# Alt uses the Space Meta layer, including repeats and release.
0 in key KEY_SPACE down
200 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
200 out key KEY_LEFTMETA down
200 out key KEY_LEFTALT down
210 in key KEY_LEFTALT repeat
210 out key KEY_LEFTALT repeat
250 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
250 out key KEY_LEFTALT up
250 out key KEY_LEFTMETA up
300 in key KEY_SPACE up
